"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122128689543359074&title=%09As+we+mark+the+25th+anniversary+of+September+11th%2C+we+pause+to+remember+the+nearly+3%2C000+innocent+lives+stolen+from+us%2C+the+families+whose+lives+were+permanently+altered%2C+and+the+extraordinary+citizens+who+showed+unmatched+courage+in+our+darkest+hour.For+those+that+have+worn+the+turnout+gear%2C+today+carries+a+heavy%2C+sacred+weight.+I+am+forever+humbled+by+the+memory+of+the+343+FDNY+firefighters%2C+alongside+police+officers%2C+paramedics%2C+and+first+responders%2C+who+ran+toward+danger+and+made+the+ultimate+sacrifice.What+the+terrorists+failed+to+realize+is+that+the+American+spirit+cannot+be+crushed+by+steel+and+smoke.+In+the+days+and+weeks+that+followed%2C+we+didn%27t+look+at+each+other+through+the+lens+of+politics+or+division.+We+looked+at+each+other+as+neighbors%2C+as+protectors%2C+and+as+Americans.+We+met+unimaginable+hatred+with+an+overwhelming+wave+of+compassion%2C+unity%2C+and+shared+humanity.Today%2C+let+us+honor+the+fallen+not+just+with+our+words%2C+but+by+how+we+live.+Let+us+recommit+to+the+unity+that+carried+us+through+twenty-five+years+ago.+Let+us+support+our+first+responders+who+step+up+to+protect+our+communities+every+single+day.+And+above+all%2C+let+us+ensure+that+future+generations+understand+the+cost+of+our+freedom.We+will+%23neverforget+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122130358557359074&title=%09Thank+you+to+the+St.+Cloud+Area+Chamber+of+Commerce+for+hosting+Wednesday%E2%80%99s+candidate+forum+and+giving+our+community+the+opportunity+to+hear+directly+from+the+candidates+running+to+represent+our+area+at+the+State+Capitol.I+was+grateful+for+the+opportunity+to+participate%2C+discuss+the+issues+facing+Senate+District+13%2C+and+share+my+vision+for+representing+the+families%2C+businesses%2C+and+communities+that+make+Central+Minnesota+such+a+great+place+to+call+home.Forums+like+this+are+an+important+part+of+the+election+process.+Thank+you+to+the+Chamber%2C+everyone+who+helped+organize+the+event%2C+and+those+who+took+the+time+to+attend+and+stay+engaged+in+the+future+of+our+communities.I%E2%80%99m+looking+forward+to+continuing+the+conversation+across+Senate+District+13+as+we+head+toward+Election+Day+on+November+3%21www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg+%23MNSenate+%23District13+%23SmallBusiness%23chamberofcommerce+%23MNPolitics+%23Vote2026+%23MNVotes+%23GOP+%23GapinskiforMNSenate+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122131049319359074&title=%09I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+have+earned+the+endorsement+of+NFIB+Minnesota%21Small+businesses+are+the+backbone+of+our+communities%2C+and+I+am+committed+to+making+Minnesota+a+place+where+they+can+grow%2C+create+jobs%2C+and+thrive.Thank+you+to+our+small+business+owners+for+your+confidence+and+support%21www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg+%23MNSenate+%23District13+%23SmallBusiness+%23MNPolitics+%23Vote2026+%23MNVotes+%23GOP+%23GapinskiforMNSenate+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122131928079359074&title=%09Photos+from+Central+Minnesota+Manufacturers+Association%27s+post+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122132369913359074&title=%09Last+week%2C+I+had+the+opportunity+to+participate+in+the+Association+of+Minnesota+Counties+%28AMC%29+Fall+Policy+Conference+in+Bemidji.As+a+Benton+County+Commissioner+and+Chair+of+AMC%E2%80%99s+Public+Safety+Policy+Committee%2C+I+spend+a+great+deal+of+time+working+on+issues+that+affect+counties+across+Minnesota.+The+Fall+Policy+Conference+brings+county+officials+together+for+important+conversations+and+presentations+on+policies+that+affect+Minnesotans%2C+their+communities%2C+and+their+wallets.I+was+also+grateful+to+AMC+for+asking+me+to+participate+in+a+panel+on+legislative+engagement.+Counties+work+with+legislators+on+a+regular+basis%2C+often+navigating+challenging+policy+discussions+while+explaining+how+decisions+made+in+St.+Paul+affect+the+people+and+communities+we+serve.+The+panel+was+a+great+opportunity+to+share+some+of+what+I%E2%80%99ve+learned+through+that+work+and+hear+perspectives+from+county+leaders+across+Minnesota.We+also+had+the+opportunity+to+hear+from+gubernatorial+candidate+Lisa+Demuth.+She+has+real+vision+on+addressing+these+topics+and+restoring+MN.+Thank+you+to+her%2C+and+I+look+forward+to+serving+with+her+in+St+Paul%2C+helping+change+the+trajectory+of+the+state+of+MInnesota.+Conferences+like+this+are+valuable+because+they+bring+local+leaders+together+to+have+serious+conversations+about+the+issues+we+deal+with+every+day%E2%80%94from+public+safety+and+county+services+to+state+mandates%2C+funding%2C+and+the+relationship+between+counties+and+the+Legislature.I+appreciate+AMC+and+everyone+who+took+part+in+this+year%E2%80%99s+conference.+I%E2%80%99m+grateful+for+the+opportunity+to+represent+Benton+County+in+these+statewide+discussions+and+to+continue+learning+from+county+leaders+throughout+Minnesota.+www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg+%23MNSenate+%23District13+%23MNPolitics+%23Vote2026+%23MNVotes+%23GOP+%23GapinskiforMNSenate+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122133579771359074&title=%09We+need+to+take+a+serious+look+at+ALL+programs+at+the+state+level.Minnesotans+who+need+help+are+looking+for+a+hand+up%2C+not+a+handout.+At+the+same+time%2C+we+need+to+dig+deeper+into+funded+and+unfunded+mandates+pushed+down+to+local+governments.+Those+mandates+have+real+consequences+for+taxpayers+when+local+levies+are+set+each+year.Under+the+DFL-led+trifecta%2C+Minnesota+has+seen+an+%2418+billion+surplus+disappear%2C+billions+lost+to+fraud%2C+the+cost+of+government+increase+by+40%25%2C+and+now+we+face+a+substantial+upcoming+deficit.Whether+you%E2%80%99re+red%2C+blue%2C+or+independent%2C+Minnesotans+simply+cannot+afford+more+of+the+same.We+need+to+tighten+the+purse+strings.+We+need+to+cut+wasteful+spending.+We+need+to+get+serious+about+taxes.+And+we+need+to+recognize+that+while+people+sometimes+need+a+hand+up%2C+taxpayers+deserve+accountability+for+where+their+hard-earned+dollars+are+going.Government+may+not+be+a+business%2C+but+it+still+has+a+responsibility+to+operate+within+its+means.+If+a+local+business+continually+spent+beyond+what+it+could+sustain%2C+ignored+inefficiencies%2C+and+failed+to+properly+account+for+its+money%2C+eventually+there+would+be+serious+consequences.+State+government+should+be+held+to+a+high+standard+of+fiscal+responsibility+as+well.This+doesn%E2%80%99t+have+to+be+complicated.+We+need+to+bring+some+common+sense+and+accountability+back+to+state+government.If+money+were+no+object%2C+we+could+fund+everything.+Unfortunately%2C+that+isn%E2%80%99t+reality.+It%E2%80%99s+time+for+a+serious+conversation+about+our+priorities%2C+our+spending%2C+and+what+Minnesota+taxpayers+can+actually+afford.www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg+%23MNSenate+%23District13+%23BloatedGovernment+%23MNPolitics+%23Vote2026+%23MNVotes+%23GOP+%23GapinskiforMNSenate+%09%09",
